*CONTEXT: *For the tenth issue of ChinAI, waaaaay back in May 2018, I
delved into MiningLamp [=E6=98=8E=E7=95=A5=E6=95=B0=E6=8D=AE], an AI unicor=
n known as =E2=80=9CChina=E2=80=99s Palantir=E2=80=9D
that was targeting public security departments as key customers.
[image: ChinAI Newsletter #10: the company known as China=E2=80=99s Palanti=
r:
Mininglamp]
<https://substack.com/redirect/8dfd5830-2537-46e1-8373-6cf2888c876a?j=3DeyJ=
