=3D"margin-top:0;padding:0"><li style=3D"margin:8px 0 0 32px"><p style=3D"c=
olor:rgb(54,55,55);line-height:26px;margin-bottom:0;box-sizing:border-box;p=
adding-left:4px;font-size:16px;margin:0">The companies who mirror Palantir=
=E2=80=99s business approach (e.g., the aforementioned MiningLamp, 4Paradig=
m, etc.).</p></li><li style=3D"margin:8px 0 0 32px"><p style=3D"color:rgb(5=
