t:4px;font-size:16px;margin:0">Companies that focus on the defense + AI ver=
tical, including Jing&#39;an Technology [=E9=9D=96=E5=AE=89=E7=A7=91=E6=8A=
=80], Utenet [=E6=B8=8A=E4=BA=AD=E7=A7=91=E6=8A=80], and Stonehenge [=E4=B8=
