=E2=80=9D approach with those FDEs. According to Leiphone, =E2=80=9C</span>=
<em>Reportedly, a team within a certain major Chinese tech giant is already=
 actively benchmarking against Palantir to develop relevant products</em><s=
pan>.=E2=80=9D</span></p></li></ol><p style=3D"margin:0 0 20px 0;color:rgb(=
